{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09279","headline":"伤逝 · 韦应物","name":"伤逝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"染白一爲黑，焚木尽成灰。\n念我室中人，逝去亦不廻。\n结发二十载，宾敬如始来。\n提携属时屯，契阔忧患灾。\n柔素亮爲表，礼章夙所该。\n仕公不及私，百事委令才。\n一旦入闺门，四屋满尘埃。\n斯人既已矣，触物但伤摧。\n单居移时节，泣涕抚婴孩。\n知妄谓当遣，临感要难裁。\n梦想忽如睹，惊起复徘徊。\n此心良无已，遶屋生蒿莱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}